{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M27\",\n      \"explains\": [\"S08-B1\", \"S08-B3\"],\n      \"why\": \"181–205的急切持续过久，使身体在此刻不得不短暂松开；而148–180留下的温柔尚未消失，所以既能解释喘息般的缓解，也能解释熟悉的柔软为何重新浮现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M28\",\n      \"explains\": [\"S08-B1\"],\n      \"why\": \"它把柔软重新出现的时机归因于急迫情绪耗尽后、一直未消失的牵挂重新变得清晰，因此说明了为何此刻会再次认出安静与亲切。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M29\",\n      \"explains\": [\"S08-B2\"],\n      \"why\": \"曾经的深沉安宁及其结束后的孤单，使他在这次温暖刚出现时就更敏锐地察觉它正在过去，因此短暂感和惜别般的不舍同时浮现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M31\",\n      \"explains\": [\"S08-B1\"],\n      \"why\": \"181–205的兴奋与近乎失去边界的亲近退去后，148–180留下的简单温柔重新凸显，说明了此刻为何又认出那份熟悉而安静的气息。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M32\",\n      \"explains\": [\"S08-B2\"],\n      \"why\": \"经历过较长的安静及其后的沉迷和疲倦，使第二次温柔一出现就带着更强的时间意识，因此他会立刻感到它无法久留，还未安顿便渐渐退开。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M34\",\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"why\": \"它说明的是相信安宁以后仍能回来，因而不再紧抓当下并逐渐真正松弛；这既没有解释柔软为何此刻重新被认出，也与B2的来不及安顿、很快退开及B3的瞬间喘息不符。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M35\",\n      \"explains\": [\"S08-B3\"],\n      \"why\": \"181–205积压的屏息紧张在熟悉温柔再现时先由身体释放，直接解释了胸口像终于吸进一口气的瞬间喘息；它解释的是身体为何松开，而非温柔为何回来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M36\",\n      \"explains\": [\"S08-B2\"],\n      \"why\": \"先前安宁离去的痛苦仍在记忆中，所以这次温柔渐退时，他不再强烈挽留，而是平静地舍不得，解释了B2那种像临走前回望的温柔与不舍。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f0810865-2f06-4bfd-b842-27665310d5a1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T021938397714Z", "elapsed_seconds": 160.484, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T02:22:18.879050+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6b0a57ab3ed08631c486f78ae1685607777ae59103e42657a051beaee064dee2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T021938397714Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b10f784f46f598c5b5d7a9fa8a86e91fb2ba2b66975315e146c07400d06fa308"}}}
